    team_spike: 'Spike the Hedgehog', team_spike_role: 'Cashier',
    team_spike_trait: "Prickly personality, soft bookkeeping. Counts every penny and every word.",
    team_spike_say_0: "Penny to penny, and soon it's taxes.", team_spike_say_1: "Careful, I'm prickly. So are my receipts.", team_spike_say_2: "I hold the till tight. Like a ball. Like a grudge.",
    team_bodya: 'Beaver Bodie', team_bodya_role: 'Builder',
    team_bodya_trait: "Will build anything if you give him planks, time and peace. Nobody gives him peace.",
    team_bodya_say_0: "One more plank and it seems to hold.", team_bodya_say_1: "The beaver said it, the beaver did it. Invoice to follow.", team_bodya_say_2: "I don't gnaw granite, on principle. Just planks and nerves.",
    team_zoya: 'Zoe the Hare', team_zoya_role: 'Shop assistant',
    team_zoya_trait: "Will sell anything to anyone. Ethics cost extra.",
    team_zoya_say_0: "Step right up. The price is lower than your doubts.", team_zoya_say_1: "Best offer for you. Best offer for everyone else, too.", team_zoya_say_2: "The discount lasts until you start thinking.",
    team_tonya: 'Tonya the Turtle', team_tonya_role: 'Guard',
    team_tonya_trait: "Slow, but misses nothing. Especially other people's money.",
    team_tonya_say_0: "I'm slow. But nobody has gotten past me yet.", team_tonya_say_1: "No raccoon gets past me. I'll arrive while he's still thinking.", team_tonya_say_2: "Nobody sneaks in here. I see everyone, even when I pretend not to.",
    team_mikhas: 'Mikey the Bear', team_mikhas_role: 'Loader',
    team_mikhas_trait: "Big as a wardrobe and just as talkative. Likes heavy lifting within reason.",
    team_mikhas_say_0: "One more crate, then a break. I mean three more crates.", team_mikhas_say_1: "Light as a feather. A feather made of bricks.", team_mikhas_say_2: "Fresh goods have arrived. Fresh compared to my mood.",
    team_sonia: 'Sonia the Owl', team_sonia_role: 'Accountant',
    team_sonia_trait: "Sees poetry in a balance sheet. Doesn't sleep until the numbers match, so barely sleeps.",
    team_sonia_say_0: "The books balance. It's so rare I don't believe it.", team_sonia_say_1: "Numbers are like stars: the more there are, the less you want to understand them.", team_sonia_say_2: "Hoo. In the black again. Suspicious.",
    team_kria: 'Quackers the Duck', team_kria_role: 'Cleaner',
    team_kria_trait: "A mop, a bucket and an attitude. There's no dirt in this shop because she decided so.",
    team_kria_say_0: "Quack. It was dirty, now it's clean. No objections accepted.", team_kria_say_1: "Lift your feet, I'm mopping. Don't, and I mop with you on them.", team_kria_say_2: "Cleanliness drives sales. And my bad reputation.",
    team_zhuzha: 'Juju the Frog', team_zhuzha_role: 'Stylist',
    team_zhuzha_trait: "Sharp taste and a sharper tongue. Believes that without style even a discount looks cheap.",
    team_zhuzha_say_0: "Ribbit. This color on you... yes, let's say \"suits\".", team_zhuzha_say_1: "Fashion is a leap forward. Sometimes into a puddle, but stylishly.", team_zhuzha_say_2: "Shoes should be green. Or not. I changed my mind.",
    team_leo: 'Leo the Fox', team_leo_role: 'Manager',
    team_leo_trait: "Lives in slides and deadlines. Turns every problem into a \"growth opportunity\".",
    team_leo_say_0: "We're already in the black, per the plan. The plan is my secret.", team_leo_say_1: "Efficiency is my middle name. My first name is \"Let's do it later\".", team_leo_say_2: "Let's discuss it... at a meeting that will never happen.",
    team_pao: 'Pao the Panda', team_pao_role: 'Marketer',
    team_pao_trait: "Can turn nothing into a trend. Sometimes even something.",
    team_pao_say_0: "Sale! Let everyone see it, especially those who already bought.", team_pao_say_1: "Did you see my poster? No? Then it's working.", team_pao_say_2: "My motto: more bamboo and discounts. The rest is noise.",
    team_murzyk: 'Whiskers the Cat', team_murzyk_role: 'Electronics wizard',
    team_murzyk_trait: "Says everything just needs a reboot. Usually right. Sometimes you reboot too.",
    team_murzyk_say_0: "Purr. A new gadget arrived. The old one isn't dead yet either.", team_murzyk_say_1: "This thing runs on purring. Don't ask.", team_murzyk_say_2: "Rebooting... the cat too. Advice is free.",
    team_toma: 'Tommy the Elephant', team_toma_role: 'Caretaker',
    team_toma_trait: "Remembers where everything is, who took what and who promised what. It's frightening.",
    team_toma_say_0: "I never forget. Especially other people's debts.", team_toma_say_1: "Found a discount for the warehouse. The warehouse doesn't know it's a discount yet.", team_toma_say_2: "An elephant on the job, all under control. Until it rains.",
    capy_say_0: "Good day for trading. Even better for millions.", capy_say_1: "I have to water the flower on my head. Yes, I know how that sounds.", capy_say_2: "One coin and huge plans. Worse businesses started with less.",

    storyNote: "All the unlocked chapters are here. Re-reading is free.",
