    shnyrJoined: "Shnyr is on the team now. Check the \"Team\" tab. And keep an eye on the till.",
    team_shnyr: 'Shnyr the Raccoon', team_shnyr_role: 'Sly consultant', team_shnyr_trait: "Knows every loophole. Now looks for them for good. Mostly.",
    team_shnyr_say_0: "Cunning? No, thrifty. They're different, honestly.", team_shnyr_say_1: "I know a loophole for a discount. It's legal. Almost.", team_shnyr_say_2: "I've reformed. Well, about 83%.", team_shnyr_say_3: "Cookies are my currency. Inflation is my pain.", team_shnyr_say_4: "I work honestly now. Getting used to it like new sneakers: they pinch.", team_shnyr_say_5: "Don't ask about the accounting. I meant nothing bad. At all.",
    team_shnyr_sit_0: "Sit, I'll tell you how I once took cookies. Actually, I didn't. It was a tax.", team_shnyr_sit_1: "My day is better than yesterday's me.",
