    tut1_0: "The short version. Tap the shop. It's the first and most honest way to earn.",
    tut1_1: "One more thing: in every era special animals visit the town. Tap to catch them. Catch them all in one go and you get a crystal.",
    tut1_2: "In the \"Team\" tab, hire staff. Each helps in their own way, and if you tap them on the scene they might say something. Listen.",
    tut1_3: "Expand the shop: new departments, new people, new story chapters.",
    tut1_4: "One more thing: in every era special animals visit the town. Tap to catch them. Each one fills the fortune drum, and a full drum can be spun again. How much to gamble is up to you.",
